  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe `<install>` element is being incubated at https://github.com/WICG/install-element. \n\nAs of now, Chromium is the only confirmed implementer. At the [Chromium API owners request](https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/nrQTNUDm3QI), this issue tracks integrating `<install>` into this spec, should Gecko or WebKit express interest.",
